OL,3,ATeen had leg amputated after stabbing
OL,4,Aon beach on bank holiday, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy had to have his leg
OL,7,Famputated following an "unprovoked"
OL,8,Fstabbing during a bank holiday trip to
OL,9,FBarry Island.
OL,11,FNewport Crown Court heard that the boy,
OL,12,Fwho cannot be named because of his age,
OL,13,Fwas with a group of friends in May 2026
OL,14,Fwhen the incident happened.
OL,16,FIdris Ahmed attacked the teenager after
OL,17,Fhe acted "as a peacemaker" between two
OL,18,Fgroups before the altercation.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
