OL,3,ATeen had leg amputated after stabbing
OL,4,Aon beach on bank holiday, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 19-year-old from Riverside, Cardiff
OL,7,Fdenies one charge of grievous bodily
OL,8,Fharm with intent, one charge of
OL,9,Finflicting grievous bodily harm and a
OL,10,Fcharge of possessing a knife.
